The source regeneration has completed both symbolic jet products (`189` raw variables) and is assembling the Euler coefficients. This is the exact mod-\(p\) source representation that the recovered checkpoints omitted; once built, it can be reduced against the shipped 509-element D23 basis with membership traces retained.
